  <div class="markdown level1 summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.IConsoleContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Writes a warning message to the console output with warning formatting
Typically displayed in yellow or with warning prefix to indicate caution</p>
